Appendix C: Software requirements

Students can use an augmented reality (AR) software development kit (SDK), or alternative software to create their
AR model prototype in the R070 set assignment. If alternative software is used students must create a simulated
AR experience. The assessment guidance for unit R070 gives more information about requirements for a simulated
AR experience. Alternative software may include, but is not limited to, presentation software (e.g. PowerPoint,
Google Slides and Canva).

As with all software, new SDKs may become available in the future and some SDKs may change to a paid-for
service or may become obsolete.

It is the teacher’s responsibility to ensure that any SDK or alternative software used is suitable and allows students
to access the full range of criteria.

We have provided an AR SDKs recommendations document which will help support you to choose an appropriate
SDK.

