+    "field": "practice_questions",
+    "path": "[3].marks",
+    "expect": "2 marks: an input mask enforces a specific pattern for data entry (1), for example, restricting a postcode field to the pattern of two letters, two numbers, a space, a number and two letters — so 'SW1A 1AA' would be accepted but '1234' would be rejected (1). Award 1 mark for an accurate description without an example.",
+    "value": "2 marks: an input mask enforces a specific pattern for data entry (1), for example, restricting a postcode field to a pattern such as two letters, a number, a letter, a space, a number and two letters — so 'SW1A 1AA' would be accepted but '1234' would be rejected (1). Award 1 mark for an accurate description without an example.",
