+    "lesson": 6,
+    "field": "content_html",
+    "find": "In IT contexts, this includes: positioning screens to reduce glare, providing ergonomic chairs and keyboards to prevent repetitive strain injury, ensuring cables are managed to prevent tripping hazards, and offering regular breaks from screen use.",
