+    "expect": "1 mark: the correct answer is the option that is not a pillar. The four pillars are people, process, data and things. Distractor options (one correct answer to select as NOT a pillar): Software / Network / Cloud / Algorithm. Award 1 mark for identifying the option not in the four pillars.",
+    "value": "1 mark: Software (only). Distractors: People, process, data and things (all IoE pillars).",
+    "severity": "HIGH",
+    "note": "F9: Supplies a unique correct answer and pillar distractors."
+  },
+  {
+    "lesson": 10,
+    "field": "content_html",
+    "find": "Google&rsquo;s lightweight operating system designed primarily for Chromebook laptops; almost all functionality runs through the Chrome browser and web-based applications rather than locally installed software.",
