+    "value": "1 mark: accept any one accurate contrast, e.g. App Store apps must pass Apple review, although some regions allow alternative distribution (1); OR Android is open-source and runs on devices from many different manufacturers, whereas iOS runs only on Apple devices (1); OR Android is used on a wider range of screen sizes and hardware specs, requiring designers to plan for more variation (1).",
